{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning. I'm Maj. Okafor, the Signal Officer. I'll be signing off on the equipment allocation and operating plan for the portable power modules. Before I finalize anything, I need to hear from supply and operations on any updates that might affect how we assign PB-1, PB-2, and PB-3 to the communications shelter, cold-storage point, and maintenance tent. Who's ready to start?"}
```

