{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, sir. Lt. Marin, S-4. I have an update that directly affects module assignment. PB-2 is the only module with the certified adapter for the cold-storage controller. I confirmed that this morning and it's recorded on the receiving worksheet, though it hasn't been entered on the equipment allocation sheet yet. This means PB-2 needs to go to the cold-storage point."}
```

