```

```json
{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you both. Lt. Marin, understood — PB-2 goes to the cold-storage point due to the certified adapter requirement. Capt. Hsu, go ahead and put the higher-headquarters tasking message on the record now. I need to hear the details before I finalize the plan, especially if it affects the communications shelter assignment or operating times."}
```

